<title>UK: BNG sets 250 million mark four-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets 250 million mark four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NV BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.375     MATURITY    30.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.625   PAY DATE    03.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    100.10    SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  HOLLAND   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.525     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 117</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
